                <h2 class="eyebrow">Biography</h2>
                <h1>About</h1>
                <p>I am Tommaso, born in 2003 in Modena, a city that shaped my early perspective and sensitivity toward images and everyday details.</p>
                <p>n 2023, after completing my studies, I decided to move to Milan to attend the three-year photography program at the CFP Bauer. Those years represented an important phase of growth, where I had the opportunity to deepen both the technical and conceptual aspects of visual storytelling, refining my approach and understanding of the medium.</p>
                <p>Alongside my academic path, I worked as an assistant for photographers and videomakers in Modena, experiencing firsthand the dynamics of professional productions and learning the discipline behind creative work. These collaborations allowed me to develop a practical mindset and adaptability on set.</p>
                <p>At the moment, my practice moves fluidly between photography and video, with a growing focus on visual production in the music and fashion fields. Rather than confining myself to a single direction, I am currently exploring different languages and formats, allowing experimentation to guide my evolution and help define a clearer identity over time.</p>
                <p>My work is driven by curiosity, research, and the desire to translate atmosphere and authenticity into images.</p>
